{
  "_what": "Every policy on an app table that no other pinned list names, by permissive flag, command, roles and the exact deparse of both halves. With PERMISSIVE_POLICIES, PINNED_POLICIES and the five closure lists in scripts/db/run.mjs it closes the policy set of schema app: the policy set probe names any policy on any table, in any schema but the system ones, that none of them names (weak-assertion survey §6 item 7, \"a rule binding the permissive policy set per table\").",
